r the reported discovery 2024-04-04T01:00"},{"at":"T+14d","status":"reported","note":"final report dated 2024-05-10, 10 days after the event ended"}],"compound_match":false,"reported":{"facility":"Pasadena Performance Products","compound":"Butane, N-","pounds":431.51,"start_local":"2024-04-04T01:00","end_local":"2024-04-30T07:00","tz":"local (CDT)","cause":"Instrument Air Compressor tripped resulting in a process upset in the Dimerization and Alkylation Units with process streams being routed to the flare for control","match_basis":"ongoing (started 2024-04-04)","travel_h":0.93,"travel_speed_mph":5.9,"travel_distance_km":8.8,"start_to_spike_h":201.0,"arrival_local":"2024-04-04T01:55","spike_hour_local":["2024-04-12T10:00","2024-04-12T11:00"]}},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_0069","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[70.0,115.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On April 12, 2024, the Texas state monitor at Houston Milby Park recorded 23.33 ppb of 1,3-butadiene in the 9:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.135 ppb. Wind there came from 115 degrees at 5.9 mph. 47 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. One of them, Pasadena Performance Products, filed report 420878 for a release starting near that hour, but the report does not list 1,3-butadiene, so it does not match this reading. Requested follow-up: confirm what caused this 1,3-butadiene reading.","draft_es":"El 12 de abril de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en Houston Milby Park registró 23.33 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 9:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.135 ppb. El viento venía de 115 grados a 5.9 mph. Hay 47 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Pasadena Performance Products, presentó el informe 420878 por una emisión que empezó cerca de esa hora, pero el informe no incluye 1,3-butadieno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de 1,3-butadieno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87894,"sha256":"2375f9582494c8511986eacd0c1eb65559bd314ab3162542923d26f3713455d9","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:38+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87841,"sha256":"ad09b44f1ba973e847620c1f993365d24266d9be9f7241ceaea5668feb85fa1e","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:59+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0057_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88599,"sha256":"6be3f73caa0dc50df94586cd86d20a4e81fd1d4d7dddc4afda2326ef91a6ea39","